      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Review pilot results and finalise SOP and guides",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 36844,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, we completed the pilot this morning. Here's a quick summary. Total time was 1 hour 15 mins, which is about 10 mins longer than usual. The crew found the checklist easy to use. We had one issue where a pallet had to be re-stacked because the boxes were not stable. I've attached the filled-out log A3 with more details.",
            "mentions": [
              77364,
              54508,
              81581,
              205041
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 81581,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Thanks for the update and the detailed A3 log. I see the 10-minute delay was mostly from the re-stacking. The notes say 'crew wasn't sure how to stack the tall, narrow boxes'. This is exactly what the visual guide A4 is meant to solve. We need to make sure that guide is crystal clear.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 205041,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Yeah, a picture would have helped a lot there.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 81581,
            "reply_to": "M54",
            "text": "Exactly. I've drafted a simple diagram for stacking those specific boxes for A4, as part of T8. See attached image. We should include this. As for an immediate change before rollout, I think we need to add a line to the SOP A1: 'For non-standard cargo, consult visual guide A4 before loading'. This is a critical link.",
