            "speaker_id": 81581,
            "reply_to": "M65",
            "text": "Friday at 2 PM is difficult, that's right at shift change and people are rushing. To make sure everyone can focus, I suggest Thursday mornings at 10 AM. It's usually the quietest time of the week. We can keep it to a strict 15-minute huddle.",
