            "text": "Great. Now, for that meeting to be effective, we need the data beforehand. How will we collect the incidents and feedback? I propose that each shift supervisor is responsible for ensuring the A3 log is updated daily. Then, every Wednesday EOD, they post a link to the week's log in this channel. That gives us time to review before the meeting.",
